{"id":"17041fea36a46015a8320e058d8be4291cd18ce9","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1231381","title":"在 DeepSeek 官方 Harness 没有出来之前，用什么 Agent 更好？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"desususula","excerpt":"程序员 - @desususula - opencode claudecode codex Pi Zcode ……选择太多了😂","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n        \n        <p>opencode claudecode codex Pi Zcode ……<br>选择太多了😂</p>\n        \n    </div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926760\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a087/1963/186098_normal.png?m=1646968527\" alt=\"xooass\" data-uid=\"186098\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xooass\">xooass</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 10:24:40 +08:00\">22h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我自己没试过  但是看别人都说 opencode 的 10 刀套餐就能 ds4 flash 猛蹬</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926783\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1744/6a8a/10573_normal.png?m=1564924761\" alt=\"leafiy\" data-uid=\"10573\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/leafiy\">leafiy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 10:35:46 +08:00\">22h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我用 omp,体感比介于 5.5 和 5.6-sol-high 之间,不如 extra high,已经登了 1000 多了!</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926803\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/52ef7768198c1348371f671d5106efae?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"QlanQ\" data-uid=\"489068\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/QlanQ\">QlanQ</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 10:46:43 +08:00\">21h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我在来推荐一下，目前我觉得最屌的 jcode</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926834\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5f76/7779/76329_normal.png?m=1711676102\" alt=\"xiaoz\" data-uid=\"76329\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xiaoz\">xiaoz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 10:57:33 +08:00\">21h 44m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我目前主要用 opencode 和 zcode ，说实话没找到一个非常合适的，只能将就用。opencode 越来越吃内存，快用不起了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926846\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7bad/8a20/441003_normal.png?m=1716075803\" alt=\"ebushicao\" data-uid=\"441003\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ebushicao\">ebushicao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 11:02:07 +08:00\">21h 39m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codex ，因为 deepseek 官方这次专门加了 codex 支持。claude code 本来挺好的，但 A/总喜欢搞点恶心的小手段，付